WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:26.333
Create Demo Loom 01 and select its machine type, Rapier.

2
00:00:26.333 --> 00:00:55.500
Create Demo Operator 01 as a piece-rate weaver and approved loom operator, available for the day shift.

3
00:00:55.500 --> 00:01:57.500
Choose saved costing v2 for the demo fabric. Add 200 kg each of the required warp and weft yarns, then activate the quality for production.

4
00:01:57.500 --> 00:02:22.292
Assign the demo quality to Demo Loom 01, then find the loom on the machine board.

5
00:02:22.292 --> 00:02:49.750
Open Manage Workers, select Day Shift, find Demo Operator 01, and assign the operator to the loom.

6
00:02:49.750 --> 00:03:21.833
Enter 240 metres for the demo loom. Review worker totals and earnings, then save the shift. Other machines remain pending so their readings can be entered later.

7
00:03:21.833 --> 00:03:45.417
Open the permanent production audit receipt and worker review. The demo operator produced 240 metres at the saved Rs 16/m rate, earning Rs 3,840.
